This product includes the content-addressed AgentCard reference (card_ref)
integrity primitive contributed by AlgoVoi:

    card_ref = "sha256:" + SHA-256( RFC 8785 JCS( agent_card ) )

The canonicalization uses RFC 8785 (JSON Canonicalization Scheme) so the
reference is reproducible byte-for-byte across independent implementations.
See lambda/src/utils/integrity.py.

RFC 8785 canonicalization is provided by the "rfc8785" package
(https://pypi.org/project/rfc8785), licensed under Apache-2.0.
